## Technical Upgrade History

- Date: 2023-06-06
  Upgrade Name: Bedrock
  Description: Major rewrite — modular OP Stack architecture, EVM equivalence, ~40% gas reduction, removed OVM, new derivation pipeline
  Status: Completed (activated OP Mainnet block 94046154)
  Source: https://optimism.io/blog/bedrock

- Date: 2024-01-17
  Upgrade Name: Canyon
  Description: EIP-1559 fee market activation di L2, improved fee estimation, gas price oracle changes
  Status: Completed (activated OP Mainnet block 107987826)
  Source: https://optimism.io/blog/canyon

- Date: 2024-03-27
  Upgrade Name: Ecotone
  Description: Full EVM equivalence (Shanghai/Cancun), EIP-4844 blob transaction support, new precompiles, blob gas market
  Status: Completed (activated OP Mainnet block 114852307)
  Source: https://optimism.io/blog/ecotone

- Date: 2024-06-11
  Upgrade Name: Fjord
  Description: Full EIP-4844 integration (blob submission via batcher), deposit/withdrawal improvements, gas cost reductions
  Status: Completed (activated OP Mainnet block 122922307)
  Source: https://optimism.io/blog/fjord

- Date: 2024-08 (Planned)
  Upgrade Name: Granite
  Description: Interop messaging antar OP Stack chains, shared sequencing foundation, fault proof system improvements, Superchain activation
  Status: In Progress (testnet testing)
  Source: https://optimism.io/blog/granite

